    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n98561" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμπάρ-ειμι</span></b> ,(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰμί</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sum) to be present also</i> or
				<i>at the same time</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Lac.</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12.3
			</span></i>, etc.; freq. in Pap., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				5.509.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, etc.; of a desire, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.38
			</span></i>; of planets, <i>occupy a position together</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				60.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stand by, come to help</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
