			; of an advocate, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.158
			</span></i>; <i>act as</i> one's <i>representative,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PRyl.
				120.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc.</div>
